{"ordinal":12273,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453491204096","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Death_0749528","source":"FatalDame: Что же будет с тобой?","target":"FatalDame: Ce se va întâmpla cu tine?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12274,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453487009799","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Death_06ffaf2","source":"FatalDame: Близких, незнакомцев, родню.","target":"FatalDame: Pe cei dragi, necunoscuți, rude.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12275,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453487009798","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Death_0d7d604","source":"FatalDame: Ты так боишься перемен, что выталкиваешь всех из своей жизни.","target":"FatalDame: Te temi atât de mult de schimbări, încât îi alungi pe toți din viața ta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12276,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453487009797","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Ears_DontShoot_06c8dd0","source":"FatalDame: Но… ты должен научиться сам выбирать, что для тебя правда.","target":"FatalDame: Dar… trebuie să înveți să alegi singur ce e adevărat pentru tine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12277,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453487009796","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Ears_DontShoot_035fd43","source":"FatalDame: Да, в наши времена сложно фильтровать информацию.","target":"FatalDame: Da, în vremurile astea e greu să filtrezi informațiile.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12278,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453487009795","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Photo_DontShoot_0bc25e5","source":"FatalDame: Хм, нет, извини, не бери в голову.","target":"FatalDame: Hm, nu, iartă-mă, uită ce-am zis.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12279,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453487009794","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Photo_DontShoot_0d840ac","source":"FatalDame: Фотографий у тебя, наверно, не мало. Но с людьми ты держишься на расстоянии.","target":"FatalDame: Probabil ai destule fotografii. Dar de oameni ții distanță.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12280,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453487009793","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Photo_DontShoot_0ab46e2","source":"FatalDame: Ты не так любишь людей, как воспоминания о них.","target":"FatalDame: Nu iubești atât oamenii, cât amintirile despre ei.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12281,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453487009792","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Photo_DontShoot_058001f","source":"FatalDame: Мне кажется, в тебе есть странная черта характера. Или как это лучше назвать?","target":"FatalDame: Mi se pare că ai o trăsătură ciudată. Sau cum să-i spun?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12282,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453482815495","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Armpit_DontShoot_00993d4","source":"FatalDame: Но по-человечески обидно, когда на тебя наставляют оружие.","target":"FatalDame: Dar, omenește vorbind, doare când cineva îndreaptă arma spre tine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12283,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453482815494","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Armpit_DontShoot_06f75b9","source":"FatalDame: Очень страшно оказаться причиной смерти кого угодно.","target":"FatalDame: E foarte înspăimântător să fii cauza morții cuiva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12284,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453482815493","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Armpit_DontShoot_06d7645","source":"FatalDame: Я понимаю, что ты боишься за себя и других.","target":"FatalDame: Înțeleg că ți-e frică pentru tine și pentru ceilalți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12285,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453482815492","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Eyes_DontShoot_0ff1dee","source":"FatalDame: Это интересно.","target":"FatalDame: Interesant.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12286,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453482815491","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Eyes_DontShoot_0e9d34a","source":"FatalDame: Но ты… ты очень пристально смотришь в глаза.","target":"FatalDame: Dar tu… te uiți foarte stăruitor în ochi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12287,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453482815490","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Eyes_DontShoot_0a58457","source":"FatalDame: Кто-то прячет взгляд, кто-то только и осматривает признаки Гостя.","target":"FatalDame: Unii își feresc privirea, alții caută numai semnele unui Musafir.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12288,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453482815489","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Eyes_DontShoot_0a2d712","source":"FatalDame: Кто-то прячет взгляд, кто-то ищет ответы, кто-то только и осматривает признаки Гостя.","target":"FatalDame: Unii își feresc privirea, alții caută răspunsuri, iar alții caută numai semnele unui Musafir.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12289,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453482815488","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Eyes_DontShoot_002cfb9","source":"FatalDame: Интересно, что многие сейчас перестали смотреть в глаза.","target":"FatalDame: E interesant că mulți au încetat să se mai privească în ochi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12290,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453478621192","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Hands_DontShoot_0c373c4","source":"FatalDame: Не проецируй на меня прошлый опыт.","target":"FatalDame: Nu proiecta asupra mea experiențele tale trecute.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12291,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453478621191","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Hands_DontShoot_07b7200","source":"FatalDame: Но я прошу уважать и мои границы тоже.","target":"FatalDame: Dar te rog să-mi respecți și mie limitele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12292,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453478621190","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Hands_DontShoot_091a96a","source":"FatalDame: Я понимаю, что ты хочешь защититься. Защитить свои границы.","target":"FatalDame: Înțeleg că vrei să te aperi. Să-ți aperi limitele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12293,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453478621189","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Teeth_DontShoot_0467fb6","source":"FatalDame: Сделай как я. Не сразу, но ты почувствуешь себя свободнее.","target":"FatalDame: Fă ca mine. Nu imediat, dar te vei simți mai liber.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12294,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453478621188","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Teeth_DontShoot_016fb1a","source":"FatalDame: Нет смысла себя травмировать каждый раз, когда видишь триггеры.","target":"FatalDame: Nu are rost să te rănești de fiecare dată când întâlnești ceva ce-ți declanșează amintiri dureroase.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12295,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453478621187","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FatalDame_Teeth_DontShoot_0741b66","source":"FatalDame: С болезненными воспоминаниями лучше расставаться.","target":"FatalDame: E mai bine să lași în urmă amintirile dureroase.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-310.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
